menu "K1 Board Validation"

config K1_WATCHDOG_SMOKE
	bool "K1 watchdog safe smoke command"
	default n
	depends on K1_WATCHDOG && WATCHDOG
	---help---
		Build k1_wdt_smoke, a bounded real-board check for /dev/watchdog0.
		It selects a 10-second timeout, starts the watchdog, performs three
		one-second keepalives, reads status, then explicitly stops it. It
		never intentionally waits for a watchdog reset.

endmenu
